<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1301] Portables: keep portable protocol version in nodes attributes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1301</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Portable protocol version must be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;stored in node&apos;s attributes list;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;verified in a way that no two nodes have different protocol versions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12858911">IGNITE-1301</key>
            <summary>Portables: keep portable protocol version in nodes attributes</summary>
