                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14716219" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 27 Aug 2015 07:39:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Portable protocol version is now added to Ignite node&apos;s attributes list.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If two nodes have different protocol versions then a joining node will fail with corresponding exception.&lt;br/&gt;
However, in order to preserve backward compatibility, if a remote node&apos;s protocol version is null then the exception won&apos;t be thrown.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In addition, added a couple of tests that check the version.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14716220" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 27 Aug 2015 07:40:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Link to the pull-request: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/43&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/43&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
